  "details": "- CVE-2026-85501: bound the DNSSEC validation work per query (ReTrap): add\n  the val-validation-attempts and val-hash-attempts limits (default 32),\n  limit DNSKEY/RRSIG and DS key-tag matches and the NSEC/NSEC3 records\n  checked per message, shorten oversized referral DS RRsets, stop validator\n  restarts once the limits are hit, and require only the answer and\n  authority sections to be secure; the built-in val-clean-additional\n  default is now no, the shipped unbound.conf keeps val-clean-additional: yes",
